# Keep npm/pnpm state inside the workspace.
#
# The DSH file sandbox denies writes outside the session workspace, and the
# default npm cache lives at %LOCALAPPDATA%\npm-cache — so any command that
# populates it fails with EPERM. Redirecting both the metadata cache and the
# content-addressable store here keeps `pnpm install` working under the
# sandbox, and keeps machines clean. Both paths are gitignored.
cache-dir=.npm-cache
store-dir=.pnpm-store
